# SHAC (published guard) on NablaEngine: the actor's gradient is clipped by its global norm only, and training stops
# at SHAC's own exploding-gradient guard, the first update whose actor gradient norm is non-finite or above 1e6 (that
# update is not applied; OUT/HALTED records it), at the latest after 3 h. The windows are rematerialized in the backward
# (no --no-remat): the engine's remat policy keeps only its step tapes.
@base/shac.args
--physics engine --shac-strict
--hours 3
